    ☐ INT:
      ☐ number of spells that can be cast
      ☐ speed of ambient spell recall 
      ☐ use magic flourishes for greater spell effects
      ☐ mental based saving throws and checks
    ☐ WIS:
      ☐ distance of vision and detection
      ☐ bonus to finding hidden things
      ☐ resistance to spell effects
      ☐ universal awareness saving throws bonus
    ☐ CHA:
      ☐ luck points (re-rolls)
      ☐ barter modifier (how much things cost, and how much you sell for)
      ☐ fate skew - less CHA = worse fate, more CHA = better fate
